Apne Pisar Ke Husn Ka Sadqa Utaarlo<br>
akbar Abhi Hai Raah Me Laila Pukaarlo<br>
<br>
1. Ran Ki Taraf Jo Jaate Hai Humshakle Mustafa<br>
<br>
be Aas Hoke Reh Gaye Ab Shah-e-karbala<br>
<br>
ro Ro Ke Keh Rahi Hai Yeh Ab Binte Murtaza<br>
<br>
<br>
2. Atthara Saal Paala Tha Jis Noujawan Ko<br>
<br>
ruqsat Hussain Karte Hai Us Mehmaan Ko<br>
<br>
humnaam-e-murtaza Wo Nabi Ke Nashaan Ko<br>
<br>
<br>
3. Farzand Yeh Tumhara Mere Dil Ka Chain Hai<br>
<br>
taskeen-e-qalb Noor-e-nigah-e-hussain Hai<br>
<br>
ruqsat Ke Waqt Zainab-e-muztar Ka Bain Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
4. Run Ko Chala Hai Yeh Jo Hai Humshakl-e-mustafa<br>
<br>
abbas Se Jalaal Me Jurrat Me Murtaza<br>
<br>
madar Hai Laila Baap Hai Sultan-e-karbala<br>
<br>
<br>
5. Sonchi Thi Uska Byaah Rachane Ke Waaste<br>
<br>
basti Nayi Nayi Mai Basane Ke Waaste<br>
<br>
kya Tum Jiyogi Ashk Bahane Ke Waaste<br>
<br>
<br>
6. Bole Hussain Bete Se Baa'chashme Ashkbaar<br>
<br>
beta Hamare Seene Se Lag Jao Aik Baar<br>
<br>
tum Jaa Rahe Ho Dil Pa Nahi Mere Eqtiyaar<br>
<br>
<br>
7. Zainab Ka Dil Ho Dilbar-e-shaahinshah-e-zaman<br>
<br>
attharwin Bahar Hai Shadaab Hai Chaman<br>
<br>
bint-e-ali Ke Lab Pe Har Ek Baar Hai Suqan<br>
<br>
<br>
8. Maida'n Ki Simt Jaate Hai Ab Akbar-e-hasee'n<br>
<br>
thaame Kaleja Dekhte Hai Unko Shah-e-dee'n<br>
<br>
laila Se Roke Kehti Hai Yeh Zainab-e-hazeen<br>
<br>
<br>
9. Thaame Kamar Ko Fatima Zehra Ka Laal Hai<br>
<br>
gham Se Ajeeb Madar-e-muztar Ka Haal Hai<br>
<br>
mazhar Phupi Ke Lab Pe Faqat Yeh Meqaal Hai
